raight, no breaks along the way"},{"t":26.88,"end":29.5,"section":"Chorus","text":"Light up the grid, let the green glow"},{"t":29.5,"end":32.9,"section":"Chorus","text":"Every week is a bar, every day is a note"},{"t":32.9,"end":36.58,"section":"Chorus","text":"Turn it up loud, let the bass line roll"},{"t":36.58,"end":40.06,"section":"Chorus","text":"Run it back tomorrow, here we go"},{"t":40.06,"end":44.26,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Right now I'm deep in firstpr and Portfolio V two"},{"t":44.26,"end":47.58,"section":"Verse 2","text":"sixty-five repos, JavaScript most of all"},{"t":47.58,"end":50.7,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Cut it like an A M V, every frame in place"},{"t":50.7,"end":54.54,"section":"Verse 2","text":"Mix it like a mashup, every verse in rhyme"},{"t":54.54,"end":58.3,"section":"Breakdown","text":"Light weeks play low, heavy weeks play loud"},{"t":59.3,"end":63.12,"section":"Chorus","text":"Light up the grid, let the green glow"},{"t":63.12,"end":66.38,"section":"Chorus","text":"Every week is a bar, every day is a note"},{"t":66.38,"end":69.51,"section":"Chorus","text":"Turn it up loud, let the bass line roll"},{"t":69.98,"end":73.42,"section":"Chorus","text":"Run it back tomorrow, here we go"},{"t":76.6,"end":83.64,"section":"Outro","text":"That was one thousand thirty-three contributions from Nishal."},{"t":83.64,"end":88.88,"section":"Outro","text":"Tomorrow the numbers change, and the song does too"}],"peaks":[0.518,0.331,0.535,0.151,0.436,0.232,0.686,0.235,0.327,0.157,0.125,0.55,0.851,0.481,0.416,0.55,0.351,0.238,0.195,0.405,0.279,1.0,0.752,0.409,0.452,0.679,0.859,0.356,0.742,0.686,0.643,0.295,0.274,0.336,0.281,0.218,0.402,0.356,0.185,0.501,0.359,0.408,0.253,0.591,0.479,0.466,0.313,0.537,0.443,0.299,0.565,0.157,0.364,0.178,0.922,0.579,0.638,0.506,0.686,0.949,0.622,0.75,0.723,0.924,0.742,0.678,0.782,0.793,0.814,0.78,0.948,0.748,0.718,0.899,0.799,0.784,0.685,0.672,0.711,0.665,0.74,0.752,0.719,0.732,0.59,0.619,0.758,0.409,0.66,0.796,0.668,0.743